# RPD Skill — Cursor Rules

This project is a Claude Code Skill for product requirement documentation.

## Key Files
- SKILL.md: Main control file (bilingual EN/ZH)
- scripts/: 8 Python scripts (stdlib only, zero dependencies)
- references/: Knowledge base (templates, specs, schemas)

## Code Style
- Python: Follow existing patterns in scripts/
- All scripts must have Windows encoding fix at top
- Use safe_read_file() for file reads
- Exit codes: 0=success, 1=usage error, 2=security block, 3=validation fail, 4=git conflict

## When Modifying
- Run eval after changes: python rpd/scripts/run-eval.py
- All 11 scenarios must pass
- SKILL.md and README.md must be bilingual (EN/ZH)
- Commit message format: fix/feat/test/docs: description
